{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Night Out",
    "steam_appid": 1990510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/aee5c210d636e865a9bacaa728e0be0f.poster.avif?t=1710089947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/aee5c210d636e865a9bacaa728e0be0f.webm?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/aee5c210d636e865a9bacaa728e0be0f.mp4?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Looks like you have a Date to go to! Excited? You should be! Play with 1-4 people remote play as you rush to your table to have the best Night Out! Solve Puzzles, do parkour, work together, and GET TO YOUR TABLE! </strong><br><br>Initially created as a relationship game, we still believe that Night Out isn't just fun but can also fix cracks in friendships and relationships...To create a better foundation for your friendships...relationships...and courtships. Created by Wicked Pixels we will push toward our goal of creating something fun, challenging, and communication-driven.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/d9d8a1df20b923a83bd7c038027b7c77.avif?t=1710089947\" /></div><br>Sometimes it's better to play by yourself. With solo mode, we bring you levels that will force you to have precise parkour skills and use your brain. Solo mode is a great way to grind on XP, and TIPS!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels built for one person </li><li> Grind TIPS to use in the shop </li><li> Different levels from Co-op! </li><li> Complete the level with a 3 Star!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/c862c8444a2f61db875455479ac9a493.avif?t=1710089947\" /></div><br>Night Out is a <strong>cooperative</strong> online platformer puzzle game for 1-4 players <br>Only one thing is important...<strong><u>FIND YOUR TABLE!</u></strong> With tons of Levels (And more to come each season) we bring to you special, fun gimmicks, and challenging levels! You will have to communicate with your peers in order to successfully get to your table and have a wonderful <strong>Night Out</strong>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Funny and Happy Times! </li><li> Work together! Its all or nothing </li><li> Levels built for fun and help communication skills</li></ul> <i>We plan on releasing game modes such as a 2V2 mode and a 4 Player CO-OP later in our game release...</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/f1e92aa6747a7381f1e129913fba32db.avif?t=1710089947\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customization: Colors </li><li> Remote Play </li><li> Different ways to play </li><li> Loot Box System and Featured Shop </li><li> New Challenges </li><li> Achievements </li><li> Secured Data</li></ul> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/1fde9382dabfc02f6d162b535ea0b0da.poster.avif?t=1710089947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/1fde9382dabfc02f6d162b535ea0b0da.webm?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/1fde9382dabfc02f6d162b535ea0b0da.mp4?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our To Do List!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 VS 2 Race Mode </li><li> Party Modes </li><li> Nintendo Switch Support </li><li> More Customization </li><li> Leaderboards </li><li> More Settings </li><li> Online Mode</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/aee5c210d636e865a9bacaa728e0be0f.poster.avif?t=1710089947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/aee5c210d636e865a9bacaa728e0be0f.webm?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/aee5c210d636e865a9bacaa728e0be0f.mp4?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Looks like you have a Date to go to! Excited? You should be! Play with 1-4 people remote play as you rush to your table to have the best Night Out! Solve Puzzles, do parkour, work together, and GET TO YOUR TABLE! </strong><br><br>Initially created as a relationship game, we still believe that Night Out isn't just fun but can also fix cracks in friendships and relationships...To create a better foundation for your friendships...relationships...and courtships. Created by Wicked Pixels we will push toward our goal of creating something fun, challenging, and communication-driven.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/d9d8a1df20b923a83bd7c038027b7c77.avif?t=1710089947\" /></div><br>Sometimes it's better to play by yourself. With solo mode, we bring you levels that will force you to have precise parkour skills and use your brain. Solo mode is a great way to grind on XP, and TIPS!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels built for one person </li><li> Grind TIPS to use in the shop </li><li> Different levels from Co-op! </li><li> Complete the level with a 3 Star!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/c862c8444a2f61db875455479ac9a493.avif?t=1710089947\" /></div><br>Night Out is a <strong>cooperative</strong> online platformer puzzle game for 1-4 players <br>Only one thing is important...<strong><u>FIND YOUR TABLE!</u></strong> With tons of Levels (And more to come each season) we bring to you special, fun gimmicks, and challenging levels! You will have to communicate with your peers in order to successfully get to your table and have a wonderful <strong>Night Out</strong>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Funny and Happy Times! </li><li> Work together! Its all or nothing </li><li> Levels built for fun and help communication skills</li></ul> <i>We plan on releasing game modes such as a 2V2 mode and a 4 Player CO-OP later in our game release...</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/f1e92aa6747a7381f1e129913fba32db.avif?t=1710089947\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customization: Colors </li><li> Remote Play </li><li> Different ways to play </li><li> Loot Box System and Featured Shop </li><li> New Challenges </li><li> Achievements </li><li> Secured Data</li></ul> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/1fde9382dabfc02f6d162b535ea0b0da.poster.avif?t=1710089947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/1fde9382dabfc02f6d162b535ea0b0da.webm?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990510/extras/1fde9382dabfc02f6d162b535ea0b0da.mp4?t=1710089947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our To Do List!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 VS 2 Race Mode </li><li> Party Modes </li><li> Nintendo Switch Support </li><li> More Customization </li><li> Leaderboards </li><li> More Settings </li><li> Online Mode</li></ul>",
